                  <description>Focal onset and impaired or lost awareness (knowledge of self or environment) is a feature of focal impaired awareness seizures, previously called complex partial seizures. (Source: Fisher ea 2017, Table 2; Beniczky ea 2017, Supplement 1, ILAE seizure classification code I.B.)</description>
